age, a sequence's last action included. After the first\nboard you are shown only the cells changed since the board last shown, row by row:\n\"y12: 20-24=0 30=c\" means that in row 12 columns 20 to 24 are now color 0 and column 30\ncolor c. The whole board is shown again after a reset, or when most of it changed.\n\nScoring: an instance's baseline is the actions a person needs for its level. Solved, an\ninstance costs the actions and resets you spent over its baseline, at most 5, plus\n1 for each demonstration (at most 3 an instance). Every action and reset\ncounts toward the instance's action cap, 5 times its baseline, and an instance that\nreaches the cap unsolved costs the whole budget, 8. The instance is over when its level\ncompletes or the cap is reached. There is no way to abandon an instance, and finish is refused until the instance\nis over. Each instance is scored on its own, and lower cost is better.\n\nIn your continual harness, entries created without global_=True belong to this session and are lost with it.\n\nNew instance. Game id: task-62755ef3.\nAvailable actions: 6. Actions used: 0/215 (baseline 43.0). Demonstrations: 0/3.\nBoard:\n5555555555555555555555555555555522222244444444444444444422222255\n5555555555555555555555555555555522222244444444444444444422222255\n5555555555555555555555555555555522449999994499999944999999442255\n5555555555555555555555555555555522449999994499999944999999442255\n5555555555555555555555555555555522449999994499999944999999442255\n5555555555555555555555555555555522449999994499999944999999442255\n5555559999995588888855999999555544449999994499999944999999444455\n5555559999995588888855999999555544449999994499999944999999444455\n5555559999995588888855999999555544444444444444444444444444444455\n5555559999995588888855999999555544444444444444444444444444444455\n5555559999995588888855999999555544449999994400222244999999444455\n5555559999995588888855999999555544449999994400222244999999444455\n5555555555555555555555555555555544449999